flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens Application]) --> CheckAuth{Is User Authenticated in Session?}

    %% Unauthenticated Flow
    CheckAuth -- No --> LoginPage[Redirect to /login]
    LoginPage --> SubmitLogin[User Submits Credentials & CSRF]
    SubmitLogin --> ValidCreds{Credentials Valid & User Active?}
    ValidCreds -- No --> LoginError[Display Generic Login Error] --> LoginPage
    ValidCreds -- Yes --> GenSession[Regenerate Session ID & Store Role]
    GenSession --> CheckRole{Determine Authorized Role}

    %% Authenticated Flow
    CheckAuth -- Yes --> CheckRole

    %% Role Routing
    CheckRole -- "Role = Administrator/HR" --> AdminDash[Render Administrator / HR Dashboard]
    CheckRole -- "Role = Employee" --> EmpDash[Render Employee Self-Service Dashboard]

    %% Navigation & Action Dispatch
    AdminDash --> RouteAction[User Selects Navigation Route / Action]
    EmpDash --> RouteAction

    RouteAction --> CheckPerm{Role Authorized for Target Endpoint?}
    CheckPerm -- No --> AccessDenied[Log Security Alert & Render 403 Forbidden]
    AccessDenied --> ReturnDash[Return to Authorized Dashboard]

    CheckPerm -- Yes --> ServerValidate{Server-Side Input & CSRF Valid?}
    ServerValidate -- No --> ValError[Render User-Friendly Form Validation Errors]
    ValError --> ReturnDash

    ServerValidate -- Yes --> ExecLogic{Execute Application Logic / DSA}

    %% Logic Paths
    ExecLogic -- "Core HRIS CRUD / Leave Action" --> DBTrans{Requires Atomic Transaction?}
    
    DBTrans -- Yes --> BeginTx[Begin PDO Transaction]
    BeginTx --> RowLock[Re-check Balance & Status with Row Lock]
    RowLock --> ChecksPass{Pre-conditions Satisfied?}
    ChecksPass -- No --> RollbackTx[Rollback Transaction] --> BusinessError[Render Business Failure Feedback] --> ReturnDash
    ChecksPass -- Yes --> ApplyChanges[Update Status, Balance, Log & Notif]
    ApplyChanges --> CommitTx[Commit PDO Transaction] --> SuccessNotice[Render Success Notice] --> ReturnDash

    DBTrans -- No --> DirectQuery[Execute Prepared PDO Query]
    DirectQuery --> QuerySuccess{Query Succeeded?}
    QuerySuccess -- No --> SysError[Log System Error & Render Generic Alert] --> ReturnDash
    QuerySuccess -- Yes --> SuccessNotice

    ExecLogic -- "DSA Laboratory Benchmark" --> PreloadData[Preload Test Dataset into Memory]
    PreloadData --> RunAlgorithm[Execute Custom PHP DSA Algorithm]
    RunAlgorithm --> CalcMetrics[Track High-Res Time, Comparisons & Memory]
    CalcMetrics --> RenderBenchmark[Render Tabular & Visual Benchmark Report] --> ReturnDash

    ReturnDash --> ContinueWork{User Logs Out or Session Expires?}
    ContinueWork -- No --> RouteAction
    ContinueWork -- Yes --> TermSession[Destroy Session & Clear Cookies]
    TermSession --> End([Redirect to /login])
